note: FizzBuzz: count to 20, saying Fizz for multiples of 3, Buzz for multiples of 5,
note: and FizzBuzz for multiples of both.
to fizzbuzz of n:
    if n mod 15 is 0, give back "FizzBuzz"
    if n mod 3 is 0, give back "Fizz"
    if n mod 5 is 0, give back "Buzz"
    give back n as text
count from 1 to 20:
    say fizzbuzz of it
